# Unit14
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit14核心词汇

earn/ɜːrn/赚得；赢得/He earns a good salary every month.
earth/ɜːrθ/地球；泥土/The earth goes around the sun.
ease/iːz/容易；缓解/She solved the problem with ease.
east/iːst/东方/The sun rises in the east.
easy/ˈiːzi/容易的/The exam was easier than expected.
economic/ˌiːkəˈnɑːmɪk/经济的/The country is facing an economic crisis.
economy/ɪˈkɑːnəmi/经济/The global economy is slowly recovering.
edge/edʒ/边缘/He stood at the edge of the cliff.
edit/ˈedɪt/编辑/She edits articles for a magazine.
educate/ˈedʒukeɪt/教育/Parents should educate their children about safety.
effect/ɪˈfekt/效果；影响/The medicine had a positive effect on him.
effective/ɪˈfektɪv/有效的/This is an effective way to learn English.
effort/ˈefərt/努力/Success requires great effort.
egg/eɡ/鸡蛋/She had eggs and toast for breakfast.
either/ˈiːðər/两者之一/You can choose either option.
elaborate/ɪˈlæbərət/精心制作的；详细阐述/He gave an elaborate explanation.
elder/ˈeldər/年长的/He is the elder of the two brothers.
elect/ɪˈlekt/选举/The people elected a new president.
electric/ɪˈlektrɪk/电的/The electric car is becoming more popular.
element/ˈelɪmənt/元素；因素/Honesty is an important element of friendship.
eliminate/ɪˈlɪmɪneɪt/消除；淘汰/We need to eliminate unnecessary costs.
else/els/其他的/What else do you need?
embarrass/ɪmˈbærəs/使尴尬/His question embarrassed her.
emerge/ɪˈmɜːrdʒ/出现；浮现/New problems emerged during the project.
emergency/ɪˈmɜːrdʒənsi/紧急情况/Call 110 in case of emergency.
emotion/ɪˈmoʊʃn/感情；情绪/She tried to hide her emotions.
emphasis/ˈemfəsɪs/强调/The school puts emphasis on reading skills.
employ/ɪmˈplɔɪ/雇用/The company employs over 500 workers.
empty/ˈempti/空的/The bottle is completely empty.
enable/ɪˈneɪbl/使能够/The scholarship enabled her to attend college.
encounter/ɪnˈkaʊntər/遇到/We encountered many difficulties along the way.
encourage/ɪnˈkɜːrɪdʒ/鼓励/Teachers should encourage students to ask questions.
end/end/结束；末端/The meeting came to an end at noon.
endure/ɪnˈdjʊr/忍受；持续/He endured great pain during the treatment.
enemy/ˈenəmi/敌人/The soldiers fought bravely against the enemy.
energy/ˈenərdʒi/精力；能源/Solar energy is a clean source of power.
engage/ɪnˈɡeɪdʒ/从事；订婚/She is engaged in scientific research.
engine/ˈendʒɪn/引擎；发动机/The car has a powerful engine.
engineer/ˌendʒɪnˈɪr/工程师/He works as a software engineer.
enjoy/ɪnˈdʒɔɪ/享受/I enjoyed the concert very much.
enormous/ɪˈnɔːrməs/巨大的/The project requires an enormous amount of money.
enough/ɪˈnʌf/足够的/There is enough food for everyone.
ensure/ɪnˈʃʊr/确保/Please ensure that all doors are locked.
enter/ˈentər/进入/Please enter your password to log in.
enterprise/ˈentərpraɪz/企业/He started a small enterprise last year.
enthusiasm/ɪnˈθuːziæzəm/热情/She showed great enthusiasm for the project.
entire/ɪnˈtaɪər/整个的/He spent the entire day reading.
entrance/ˈentrəns/入口/The entrance to the building is on the left.
environment/ɪnˈvaɪrənmənt/环境/We must protect the natural environment.
equal/ˈiːkwəl/平等的/All people are equal before the law.
